    {
      "id": "p0034-b011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "As we've seen in this chapter, a lot can get lost in translation if you only focus on the words used. Recognizing and preserving the ideas behind those words is arguably more important, and is at the heart of what localization is all about.",
        "raw": "As we've seen in this chapter, a lot can get lost in translation if you only focus\non the words used. Recognizing and preserving the ideas behind those words is\narguably more important, and is at the heart of what localization is all about.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.29322217,
          0.66776429,
          0.89776789,
