    {
      "id": "p0034-b012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "In this third Legends of Localization book, we'll look at the specific things that changed during Undertale's translation process into Japanese. And given that the game relies so much on humor, unique speech patterns, cultural references, and more, there'll surely be a lot to discover!",
